  "narration": [
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-1",
      "transcript": "How can light reveal an obstacle without being absorbed or reflected by it?",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 5.3,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.b5a7d5e28a01e089655359e9920607de1e175de741aef264c289f18affd10001",
        "sha256": "b5a7d5e28a01e089655359e9920607de1e175de741aef264c289f18affd10001"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-2",
      "transcript": "Start with one photon and two possible paths that meet again.",
      "start": 5.666666666666667,
      "duration": 4.275,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.3cc7f830aab16fbe1180fea2dc497da608a7350dfb9f40b2a6cf983ae73f752c",
        "sha256": "3cc7f830aab16fbe1180fea2dc497da608a7350dfb9f40b2a6cf983ae73f752c"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-3",
      "transcript": "In this carefully aligned setup, the waves associated with the paths cancel at one output. This detector stays dark.",
      "start": 10.166666666666666,
      "duration": 8.2,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.6ec6226033244d73d87cfc65126efc77f146d7daf1a762760dba8c2ffa92642e",
        "sha256": "6ec6226033244d73d87cfc65126efc77f146d7daf1a762760dba8c2ffa92642e"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-4",
      "transcript": "Now block one path with an absorber.",
      "start": 18.566666666666666,
      "duration": 2.75,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.a48ed0b4adf4abaaab5c8d03ef27fa6437ee24cb22ee7f71c5bcddffb2f77324",
        "sha256": "a48ed0b4adf4abaaab5c8d03ef27fa6437ee24cb22ee7f71c5bcddffb2f77324"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Sometimes it absorbs the photon. That trial ends.",
      "start": 21.533333333333335,
      "duration": 3.925,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.8691c50b36e8b01361056d2a506c11db4c4c25acb6b2da37f58c19155e7a391e",
        "sha256": "8691c50b36e8b01361056d2a506c11db4c4c25acb6b2da37f58c19155e7a391e"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-6",
      "transcript": "But in another trial, the dark detector clicks.",
      "start": 25.666666666666668,
      "duration": 3.275,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.0318ddb45a941f1ce49bf5f0797371a9422059945a83a9e94e6dbab195a4127b",
        "sha256": "0318ddb45a941f1ce49bf5f0797371a9422059945a83a9e94e6dbab195a4127b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-7",
      "transcript": "The photon reached this detector. The obstacle was detected, without absorbing that photon.",
      "start": 29.333333333333332,
      "duration": 6.525,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.56e225ebf7231b2a2af57ba62659f75e39f670f91d14af7442fff6ea27fb0d08",
        "sha256": "56e225ebf7231b2a2af57ba62659f75e39f670f91d14af7442fff6ea27fb0d08"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-8",
      "transcript": "Why? Blocking one possible path removed the cancellation that kept this detector dark.",
      "start": 36.06666666666667,
      "duration": 6.05,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.82a51dd5df9b5eac94836ee2c121e98be69aa1aab19a018e3d79384805e2161e",
        "sha256": "82a51dd5df9b5eac94836ee2c121e98be69aa1aab19a018e3d79384805e2161e"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-9",
      "transcript": "This is interaction-free measurement, demonstrated in experiments.",
      "start": 42.333333333333336,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.21ed8f6da9a76a0a9b7833df64bc47ce61b16213db31aee5c972bffcf7afaf81",
        "sha256": "21ed8f6da9a76a0a9b7833df64bc47ce61b16213db31aee5c972bffcf7afaf81"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ifm-v3-cue-10",
      "transcript": "It succeeds only in some trials. Others absorb the photon, or give no clear answer.",
      "start": 47.3,
      "duration": 6.275,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.6ec405a5b469c85fd5cb4535eee60937230d4a7a26821ac3097b13cf017280cf",
        "sha256": "6ec405a5b469c85fd5cb4535eee60937230d4a7a26821ac3097b13cf017280cf"
      }
    }
